unarr
------------------------------------------
(lib)unarr is a decompression library for RAR, TAR, ZIP and 7z* archives.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libbz2-devel-1.0.8-2
  libbz2_1-1.0.8-2
  liblzma-devel-5.8.4-1
  liblzma5-5.8.4-1
  libunarr-devel-1.2.0-1bl1
  libunarr1-1.2.0-1bl1
  pkg-config-3.0.10-1
  zlib-devel-1.4-1
  zlib0-1.4-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cmake-4.4.5-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  libbz2-devel-1.0.8-2
  libcmocka-devel-2.0.2-1
  liblzma-devel-5.8.4-1
  ninja-1.13.2-1
  zlib-devel-1.4-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/selmf/unarr

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/selmf/unarr/archive/refs/tags/v1.2.0.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack unarr-1.2.0-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./unarr-1.2.0-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/unarr-1.2.0-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/unarr-1.2.0-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libunarr1-1.2.0-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libunarr-devel-1.2.0-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(unarr)
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/unarr.README
  /usr/share/doc/unarr/AUTHORS
  /usr/share/doc/unarr/CHANGELOG.md
  /usr/share/doc/unarr/COPYING
  /usr/share/doc/unarr/README.md

(libunarr1)
  /usr/bin/cygunarr-1.dll

(libunarr-devel)
  /usr/include/unarr.h
  /usr/lib/cmake/unarr/unarr-config.cmake
  /usr/lib/cmake/unarr/unarr-targets-relwithdebinfo.cmake
  /usr/lib/cmake/unarr/unarr-targets.cmake
  /usr/lib/cmake/unarr/unarr-version.cmake
  /usr/lib/libunarr.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/libunarr.pc

